{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono la tua nuova vicina.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Mi auguro di incontrarti spesso
qui {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Erinnerst du dich noch?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Wir haben uns in {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}}
