Io sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Tanto piacere.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tu conosci {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Sai,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:002B:}}mi
